spans.s:
(rather Nom. fr. मृग; cf. √ मार्ग्, मृज्) cl. 4. P., Ā. 10 (Dhātup. xxvi, 137; xxxv, 46) मृग्यति, मृग॑यते (mc. also P. ˚ति; pr. p. मृगयाण, MBh.),
to chase, hunt, pursue, RV. &c. &c.;
to seek, search for or through, investigate, examine, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to visit, frequent, MBh.;
to seek or strive after, aim at, endeavour to obtain (acc.), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to desire or request or ask anything (acc.) from (abl., -तस्, gen. with or without सकाशात्), Kathās.
